MdeMat includes sphere_lebedev_rule MATLAB source attributed in its original
headers to Dmitri Laikov and John Burkardt. The mathematical rules are described
by Vyacheslav Lebedev and Dmitri Laikov, Doklady Mathematics 59(3), 1999, 477-481.

Upstream: https://people.math.sc.edu/Burkardt/m_src/sphere_lebedev_rule/
The upstream source page licenses this code/data under GNU LGPL and does not
name a version. GNU LGPL 3 and its corresponding GPL 3 texts are supplied.
The source files carry author/reference headers but no explicit copyright year;
this notice does not invent a year or replace any original attribution.

Local modifications: v4 edits headings/parameter documentation and uses
elementwise multiplication in xyz_to_tp. MdeMat's runtime package qualifies
intra-library calls as mdemat.internal.lebedev.*; the mathematical rule tables
are retained. Full editable runtime source is supplied with the toolbox.
